ou see this?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"این را می‌بینید؟","transliteration":"een rah mee-bee-need?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-light-move","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Tell me if you see the light move.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"اگر نور حرکت کرد به من بگویید.","transliteration":"ah-gar noor hah-reh-kat kard beh mun beh-goo-yeed","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-look-nose","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Look at my nose.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"به بینی من نگاه کنید.","transliteration":"beh bee-nee-yeh mun neh-gah koh-need","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-double","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Do you see two of me?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"آیا مرا دوتا می‌بینید؟","transliteration":"ah-yah mah-rah doe tah mee-bee-need?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-worse-direction","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Is it worse looking this way?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"وقتی به این طرف نگاه می‌کنید بدتر است؟","transliteration":"vagh-tee beh een tah-raf neh-gah mee-koh-need bad-tar ast?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-shine","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"I am going to shine a light in your eyes. Please look at the wall behind me.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"با چراغ به چشمانتان نور می‌تابانم. به دیوار پشت سر من نگاه کنید.","transliteration":"bah cheh-rahgh beh chesh-mah-neh-tahn noor mee-tah-bah-nam. beh dee-vahr posht-eh sar-eh mun neh-gah koh-need","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-dont-look-light","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english"